title: "LITHOS: Literature Retrieval and Source Validation for Scoping Reviews"
abstract: "A command-line tool for retrieving candidate literature from OpenAlex, validating records against Crossref, and producing screening tables for scoping reviews. Designed for use by LLM agents and researchers."
